WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.179 --> 00:00:04.120
SCP-682 Vs SCP-826.

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:08.850
These magical dragon bookends can really bring
fiction to life, but could they make the dream

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:11.560
of killing SCP-682 a reality?

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:15.840
A short story written by a researcher entitled
The Generally Nice, Friendly Thing That Can

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:21.000
And Will Kill SCP-682 Permanently if it So
Much As Spots That Damn Lizard - which we

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.720
imagine was very cathartic to write - was
placed between the bookends.

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:30.470
A D-Class on a motorcycle lured SCP-682 into
this new fantasy world to fight the Generally

00:00:30.470 --> 00:00:34.390
Nice, Friendly Thing, and an epic battle between
the two unfolded.

00:00:34.390 --> 00:00:39.700
However, when the battle came to an end, 682
lived, and the Thing had been torn apart.

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:44.440
When it was returned to its containment chamber,
the title of the book had become, “The Generally

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:50.399
Nice, Friendly Thing That Tried To Kill SCP-682
Permanently But Failed”, with almost 200

00:00:50.399 --> 00:00:54.170
extra pages detailing the epic but ultimately
fruitless battle.

